			"name": "Klan: Bad Moons",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Bad Moons are the richest Klan, trading in teef (Ork currency, quite literally teeth) for the best dakka and gear any Ork can buy — flashy, gold-painted, and widely resented for it.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-Klan flavour lens.",
